  "editorial": {
    "name": "portabletext/svelte-portabletext",
    "descriptionZh": "把 Portable Text 结构化内容渲染成 Svelte 组件的库，装 @portabletext/svelte 后传一段 Portable Text 数组就能出带格式与文本样式的块内容，图片、自定义块与 marks 再用 components 属性逐个接。",
    "takeawayZh": "装 @portabletext/svelte 渲染富文本块",
    "noteZh": "README 标题 Portable Text renderer for Svelte，首句 Render Portable Text block content with Svelte components，安装是 npm i @portabletext/svelte -D，紧跟一条警告 Svelte 5.0.0 or higher is required。用法示例最简只写 <PortableText value={[...]} />，接着一节 Customizing rendering 讲用 components 属性决定每种块怎么处理，另有 Disabling warnings / handling unknown types 与 Rendering Plain Text 两节。文件列表里 src 的提交信息是 migrate to Svelte 5，tests 那条写 nest lists as deeply as their level says，仓库还留着 MIGRATING-v1.md；MIT license，91 stars，最新 Release v4.0.0。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
